{"id":"ed1e3a5f7280b09a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-comb8-scale-function.md","title":"ZFC Comb8 Scale Function","display":"df-zfc-comb8-scale-function — ZFC Comb8 Scale Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb8-scale-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb8-scale-function"],"display":"df-zfc-comb8-scale-function — ZFC Comb8 Scale Function","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-product.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb8-scale-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-scale-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb8-scale-function — ZFC Comb8 Scale Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3579e07be41aa5cd\" href=\"?note=3579e07be41aa5cd\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-product.md\">../batch10/58-df-product.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\lambda,\\mathcal P,I,R \\in V\">\\(F,\\lambda,\\mathcal P,I,R \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ScaleFunction}_S \\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ScaleFunction}_S \\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}scale\\text{-}function}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ScaleFunction}_S(F,\\lambda,\\mathcal P,I,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\exists A\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S(A,\\mathcal P,I)\n\\land R\\subseteq A\\times A\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\lambda,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\\langle F(\\alpha),F(\\beta)\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall g\\in A\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\langle g,F(\\alpha)\\rangle\\in R\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}scale\\text{-}function}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ScaleFunction}_S(F,\\lambda,\\mathcal P,I,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\exists A\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S(A,\\mathcal P,I)\n\\land R\\subseteq A\\times A\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\lambda,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\\langle F(\\alpha),F(\\beta)\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall g\\in A\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\langle g,F(\\alpha)\\rangle\\in R\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> indexes the product and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is the explicit eventual-order relation on its carrier.</li>\n<li>A scale must be both increasing and cofinal in the chosen eventual order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-product.md","status":"resolved","id":"3579e07be41aa5cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-product.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,\\lambda,\\mathcal P,I,R \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ScaleFunction}_S \\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}scale\\text{-}function}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ScaleFunction}_S(F,\\lambda,\\mathcal P,I,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\exists A\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S(A,\\mathcal P,I)\n\\land R\\subseteq A\\times A\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\lambda,A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\\langle F(\\alpha),F(\\beta)\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall g\\in A\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\langle g,F(\\alpha)\\rangle\\in R\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1295,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1720","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-comb8-scale-function.md|58-df-zfc-comb8-scale-function]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["3579e0